#: scenario:scenario_733932F8_99D6_4C79_AA66_A85288D2ABBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43394a087ba564339d25a87ec3a2bf62e151de75569431e998851322fbffa8a6
#. default-sha256: ba4800764fff636ebd476e5e9b58903cac44e88513a866e93762c07371b713f3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_733932F8_99D6_4C79_AA66_A85288D2ABBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The room with the fireplace was always kept in pristine "
"condition so they could entertain guests at any time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫난로가 있는 홀은 ⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫내빈객을 위해 항상 아름답게 유"
"지되어 있었습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_93990DC2_AEFA_4178_8839_92F278F31293
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e3f226057646380ebabb55e4b8d20fbef9c967080347de9f99f9da4c1d7e68af
#. default-sha256: f518a97b3c783118c9fd901f7b1efecc57f5923bc64b9f870fc16a9e9a7eb8e1
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_93990DC2_AEFA_4178_8839_92F278F31293"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Walls colorfully decorated with tapestries and stained-glass windows gave testament to their "
"great fortune."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫벽에 걸린 태피스트리, ⟪k:1⟫산뜻한 벽지, ⟪k:2⟫창틀에 낀 색유리창, ⟪k:3⟫모두 풍요의 증거였지요."

#: scenario:scenario_C484908D_52F5_4594_95F3_954AECDEE522
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cab2fda7b8caf6e6c68b30cd03dc2cbc3bf6eaa9b93859d23b538e020edcd183
#. default-sha256: b933c15a5ae18cd0e38d6913cf2e423fe38dfa027b2cbf8f4c35b174a0069f1b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C484908D_52F5_4594_95F3_954AECDEE522"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The servants’ first assignment every morning was to clean this room."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫무엇보다 고용인이 아침에 맨 먼저 보는 업무가 ⟪k:1⟫홀 청소였거든요."

#: scenario:scenario_18E382B8_1ECB_4769_8786_65433954308B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d80454995044bc988284b81915e9de56383cffe211f5d859360879bba816eb11
#. default-sha256: ba6bd8f20c382f915bbc661ec1823029da898d32dad975b01e68299aaf2c7665
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_18E382B8_1ECB_4769_8786_65433954308B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pitchers, silver plates, and silverware were polished to a shine so they could be proudly "
"put to use at a moment’s notice."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫물병, ⟪k:1⟫은접시, ⟪k:2⟫식기 모두 윤이 나도록 닦아서 ⟪k:3⟫언제 누가 와도 남 부끄럽지 않게 해 "
"두었답니다."

#: scenario:scenario_EB3B5C9C_0AF1_4DC4_82C6_D50D1E9A46AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4349a7791c5a6e4aa63961d19cea3e941f8ab9b202c9e2a5946fcf60e32c3418
#. default-sha256: 7af7b035131d4f0ce9caef54d4a5046e2b1b8e38edfae110feb463b737fb3cec
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EB3B5C9C_0AF1_4DC4_82C6_D50D1E9A46AC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And for events like their daughter’s birthday, the room served an even more important role."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫더군다나 영애의 생일 파티를 한다면 ⟪k:1⟫홀의 중요성이 오죽할까요."

#: scenario:scenario_D740EFB7_CD99_4401_8898_8761EF8F9271
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 534525e132db450df8d4da862005bd323efee5c793d7e02310e4af0c7729c14b
#. default-sha256: a5fdeb6b2dcbfc6e70a9a1ca08d92fa6b50ce15250514feafc12f8ead115dd79
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D740EFB7_CD99_4401_8898_8761EF8F9271"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The tables’ tops were removable, so they had ordered new tabletops with designs made "
"especially for this occasion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫테이블 판은 탈부착이 가능해서 ⟪k:1⟫이 날을 위해 조각을 새긴 새 것을 마련했습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_B7CAB2CD_4031_4E6C_A8AF_D0F1F486DDCB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 050639456fab68cbda8f32f1618f5a7a14e4c242dd5275ac7d161d2b699b6dee
#. default-sha256: c8e0f15c1939584e3e94f4305b142cba9be13a2d33f5b41448c9b954331dd157
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B7CAB2CD_4031_4E6C_A8AF_D0F1F486DDCB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And once the banquet had drawn to a close, tables speckled with half-empty wine glasses and "
"leftover candied fruits were moved off to the side to make room for—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫of course—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"the festivities."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫저녁 식사 후에는 ⟪k:1⟫와인 몇 잔, ⟪k:2⟫설탕에 절인 과일을 남긴 테이블도 ⟪k:3⟫구석으로 치우고"
"―― ⟪k:4⟫자연스럽게 ⟪k:5⟫연회가 시작되었습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_E4783BD9_F5CF_4FB4_8F58_D3C1BFC940DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 92cd0547df741bedde7c7d6bccb3f214b6a2f4d60043b0b1ee7f2213a4973592
#. default-sha256: a10d9bc18d153457768fe72b4cb83adfdd5c5d2d875af73ca566943eac0c28df
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E4783BD9_F5CF_4FB4_8F58_D3C1BFC940DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Good evening, Lady Nellie!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫You’re looking particularly lovely "
"today."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫반가워, ⟪k:5⟫미스 넬리! ⟪k:6⟫오늘도 한층 더 아리땁게……."

#: scenario:scenario_BBFA0DBB_0B1F_4D9E_B286_7E65ADF5CEB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2c14d264d53e9d1240476291a67232032b1cc68546e97359cece590004a1b25
#. default-sha256: a3db6d7f01a73f92f0ab1b42e00c40eff87495bc0151f1ead074853ebc5b5834
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BBFA0DBB_0B1F_4D9E_B286_7E65ADF5CEB8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nellie, I had these jewels cut just for you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫넬리, ⟪k:1⟫네게 줄 보석을 가져왔어."

#: scenario:scenario_836794CF_AE93_4D51_A19A_80F37CC09A07
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c65bd77583d6e0b2614b9ddabd41a40583e36a1c865163d7f4b89239bd9647ae
#. default-sha256: cd4f6059c4bee5d20a77574d4b7adf3cad506629c6f88dffe617909a97afb3b0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_836794CF_AE93_4D51_A19A_80F37CC09A07"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You’ll let me have this dance, won’t you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫댄스는 당연히 나랑 춰 줄 거지?"

#: scenario:scenario_8C08C1EF_FE48_40AD_AF4B_91277C0864D6
