msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫............⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Haaaaaaaahh..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫…………으, ⟪k:19⟫하아아아~~~."

#: scenario:scenario_1ADB677C_2191_42BE_8E2F_65AE3D6B334A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4ce18f4b93118c95a00f74f04a9029fad50fcdbd91e0205897c32a0b8a73993
#. default-sha256: bd10eb447a2171537cef26cd234fb1a5fb9af5b00e4af68917525d0e3b283264
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1ADB677C_2191_42BE_8E2F_65AE3D6B334A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What’s the matter, Nellie?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You look exhausted."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫어, ⟪k:2⟫넬리. ⟪k:3⟫왜 그래, ⟪k:4⟫축 늘어졌는데."

#: scenario:scenario_25B59912_86D9_4430_A5F0_DB07F0529EDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5fd0bb9a7b49bb5e44948c2d8d77ec65e50f21a2f7349138532c9f94f3b6d1d3
#. default-sha256: 8f346cfab12f2b35a3d59dbac864e68d86235fe6b2964663b4dd61ee433dbadd
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_25B59912_86D9_4430_A5F0_DB07F0529EDC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫These are pretty good.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Want one? ⟪k:5⟫I know you like sweets.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"They’re apples candied in rock sugar, I think."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫이거 맛있더라. ⟪k:3⟫먹을래?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫설탕 결정에 절인 사과라는데……. ⟪k:6⟫단 거 좋아"
"하지?"

#: scenario:scenario_DA8B5329_49DB_4C6C_923F_FEDFDFE8DDA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96c43d9fd09990ea1185a2525007d590353f0d143607f4c76745b6dd044b8810
#. default-sha256: f3cf8a75fde6aa4370487c0df41c4fa4239c5bcc172f81106397a3fe6d531954
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_DA8B5329_49DB_4C6C_923F_FEDFDFE8DDA8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You disappoint me, dearest Mell."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫기가 막히네, ⟪k:2⟫오라버니……."

#: scenario:scenario_149349B0_AE96_4EFA_889E_E106147B1CB6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c60a8f42752c49574b9bac7493e0540fe60d3a9f06b1626232d17c5f082adccc
