msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though boys of his pedigree were taught to dance as part of their etiquette lessons, he "
"found himself more being dragged around by his sister. ⟪k:1⟫He could hardly be said to be "
"“attending” to her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫다른 남성은 댄스를 기본적으로 익혔지만, ⟪k:1⟫멜은 넬리를 에스코트하긴커녕 ⟪k:2⟫완전히 고삐를 "
"잡혀 다녔습니다."

