msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He ordered the servants to investigate, had the music restarted, gave a short apology for "
"the interruption, and set the party back on course."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫고용인에게 상황을 살피러 가게 하고, ⟪k:1⟫음악을 재개시킨 후, ⟪k:2⟫결례를 사죄하며 ⟪k:3⟫파티"
"를 원래대로 되돌렸지요……."

