msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They had a strong wind that night as well, which turned the raindrops into little spears on "
"the window. ⟪k:1⟫Were the party to continue on any longer, no one would be able to go home."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫더군다나 그 날 밤은 바람도 거세며 ⟪k:1⟫빗발도 창처럼 매서웠기에…… 이 이상 파티를 하면 ⟪k:2⟫아"
"무도 돌아갈 수 없어졌을 겁니다."

#: scenario:scenario_34F956BC_01B8_4DCF_A197_572FFE54D844
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
